        "title": "Must visit for a Hindu",
        "text": "Very holy place and must visit for all Hindus every year. Wash away your sins and thank god for all his help. Avoid buying anything here as they will crook you. Wear rubber slippers, do not carry any leather. Catch hold of a nice old pundit who will show you around. Tip him 100 NR at the end. Avoid those elaborate 'poojas' as it is just a 'con'. No photography permitted inside. Beware of the monkeys that snatch your Prasad etc. spend a good one hour here. Carry a lot of change to tip at all the prayer points. ( bundle of INR 10 notes fine). Buy a basket of flowers and coconuts @ NR 100/- before entering. ",
